DE:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Bist du bereit, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Das {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Insektikus-Turnier{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} von
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} fängt gleich an...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Und ich werde gewinnen!

EN:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}, when you catch a bug,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
make sure you bring it over to {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Nat{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}He's the one managing this event!

IT:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}, quando prendi
un insetto,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} portalo a {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Gustavo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}È lui l'organizzatore dell'evento!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Por fin ha dado comienzo la Caza
de Bichos de {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡La batalla va a ser ardua, larga{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
y, sobre todo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} muy divertida!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Şimdiye kadar binden fazla böcek
yakalamış olmayı bekliyordum{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Neyse.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ben zaten ağırdan açılırım!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Daha etkinliğin başındayız!

{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Etkinliğin bitmesine az kaldı,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bitmeden önce iri bir tane
daha yakalayalım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} hai fatto tutto quello
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}che avevi programmato di fare?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}L'Insettomania sta per finire,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bug-Off {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}has ended at last!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Now we just have to wait for the
awards ceremony to get going!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Ya ha terminado la Caza de Bichos!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Ahora solo queda aguardar
la entrega de premios.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}L'Insettomania si è conclusa!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Non ci resta che aspettare l'inizio
della cerimonia di premiazione!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Das Turnier ist zu Ende!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Jetzt heißt es warten auf die
Siegerehrung!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Enhorabuena por el premio! {{TAG:0003:0024:}}
En esta ocasión no he podido
estar a tu altura,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Beh, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, a quanto pare,
anche questa volta sono io il re
della competizione,{{TAG:0003:0021:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tut mir leid, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Ich meine, dass ich dich beim
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Insektikus-Turnier{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} geschlagen hab!

{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ich hab's gerade gehört, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du hast beim {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Insektikus-Turnier{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
diesmal nichts gewonnen, oder?
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Um dich aufzumuntern,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}widme ich
dir diesen Tanz!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡Llegas tarde, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
La entrega de premios ya
ha terminado,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}La próxima vez que quieras verla, 
será mejor que te pases antes.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}
¡Puede que hasta te vea en el podio!

IT:
La cerimonia di premiazione
di Insettomania ormai è finita.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Tutti i cittadini facevano il tifo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}... ed era bellissimo vederli così
uniti. {{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ancora più bello che vincere
la competizione, credimi!

Ehi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} lo sapevi?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Non so perché,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ma hanno annullato
la premiazione dell'Insettomania.
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Che peccato!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Io avevo già preparato
il mio discorso da campione.
Quanta energia cerebrale sprecata{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
